{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Start Outlook at logon with a delayed Task Scheduler task and the /recycle argument.","label":"Autostart","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/ad_hoc_wifi","label":"Ad hoc Wi-Fi","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/ad_hoc_wifi"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/bash","label":"Bash","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/bash"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRun <code class='inline'>TaskSched.msc<\/code>. From the Action pane, click <strong>Create Task\u2026<\/strong>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>General<\/h2>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Name: <code class='inline'>Start Outlook at logon<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Description: <code class='inline'>Starting Outlook via a delayed start<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<h2>Triggers<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNew trigger:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Begin the task: <strong>At log on<\/strong><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Specific user: your user account (selected automatically)<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Delay task for: <strong>2 minutes<\/strong><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Enabled: selected<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOK to close the New Trigger dialog.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Actions<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNew action. Browse to <code class='inline'>OUTLOOK.EXE<\/code>. Depending on Outlook and Windows:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Office\\Office##\nC:\\Program Files (x86)\\Microsoft Office\\Office##<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIn <strong>Add arguments (optional)<\/strong> type:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\/recycle<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOK to close the New Action dialog.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Settings<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDisable <strong>Stop the task if it runs longer than 3 days<\/strong>. That keeps Outlook from being closed if the computer stays on longer than 3 days.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/autostart\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/autostart\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/ad_hoc_wifi' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/ad_hoc_wifi' data-title='Ad hoc Wi-Fi' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Ad hoc Wi-Fi<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/bash' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/bash' data-title='Bash' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Bash<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/os\/windows.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Windows<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}